# riffle/

Riffle is a CSV filtering and pattern-matching engine with service as the public I/O boundary, sia orchestrating sense-infer-act logic, and ctx managing pure state transitions. The root application supervises the predicate evaluation cache.

## Dirs

- `cli/` -- CLI command registry and implementations
- `ctx/` -- Pure context and control knot; typed state transitions
- `predicate/` -- Predicate evaluation engine with items, loops, pipelines, DSL, caching
- `service/` -- Public I/O boundary; orchestrates runs over CSV files
- `sia/` -- Sense-infer-act pattern orchestration; bridges predicate engine with context

## Files

- `application.ex` -- OTP application; supervises Riffle.Predicate.Cache
